  "options": [
    {
      "choices": [
        {
          "default": true,
          "help": "BF16 KV sized by gpu-memory-utilization 0.80 (68.89 GiB measured upstream, 5.14 full 262K requests at once). The creator's default for chat, agents and tool use.",
          "label": "Standard (default)",
          "value": "standard"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            {
              "name": "kv-cache-memory-bytes",
              "value": 85899345920
            }
          ],
          "help": "Exact 80 GiB BF16 KV pool (2,075,828 tokens at 1,048,576 context, 1.98 full 1M requests at once, measured upstream). Upstream measured 7.2 to 7.4 GiB MemAvailable idle.",
          "label": "Max BF16 KV",
          "value": "max-bf16"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            {
              "name": "kv-cache-memory-bytes",
              "value": 79456894976
            },
            {
              "name": "kv-cache-dtype",
              "value": "fp8"
            }
          ],
          "help": "Exact 74 GiB FP8 (E4M3, unit scales, uncalibrated) KV pool (3,308,911 tokens at 1,048,576 context, 3.16 full 1M requests at once, measured upstream). FP8 KV needs about 5 GiB more outside the pool, hence 74 GiB; upstream passed a 949,953-token needle and scored 87.0 against 88.4 for BF16 on its 69-scenario tool eval.",
          "label": "Max FP8 KV",
          "value": "max-fp8"
        }
      ],
      "help": "The creator's three launch tiers on one Spark. Standard sizes a BF16 KV cache from gpu-memory-utilization 0.80 after warmup (1,346,671 tokens at 262,144 context, about 20 GiB MemAvailable left). The two max tiers set an exact KV pool for the model's native 1,048,576-token context (set the context setting to 1048576) and leave only about 7 to 8 GiB MemAvailable, so nothing else should run on the Spark.",
      "label": "Memory tier",
      "name": "tier"
    }
  ],
